      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I recommend a strategy of proactive control over the narrative, rather than waiting for the press to force the issue.  A carefully crafted, brief statement acknowledging the past vote while focusing on present commitments to the community would be strategic. Frame the vote as a nuanced, context-specific decision from a different time, and immediately pivot to the candidate's current, strong support for the *future* needs of the community center.",
